; The surface of axiom-1's third state that all four kernels agree on.
; Eight digits, low to high: nothing equals itself; is not 0; not 0 in either
; direction; not the empty string; not the empty list (an absent value is not an empty
; container); len of it is 0; it survives inside a composition and comes back itself;
; and a table answers with the ground where it holds no row — never a guess, never 0.
;
; Deliberately absent: arithmetic on nothing, ordering it, branching on it. Those are
; where the four kernels honestly differ — fkwu leaks its value encoding there, and the
; walkers throw instead of imitating. The difference is the point, so it is not pinned.
